<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; color: #212529"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Indicate
by check mark whether the registrant has submitted electronically every Interactive Data File required to be submitted pursuant to Rule
405 of Regulation S-T (&#167;232.405 of this chapter) during the preceding 12 months (or for such shorter period that the registrant
was required to submit such files). <span id="xdx_90D_edei--EntityInteractiveDataCurrent_c20230101__20230630_zSMs4HLkdVZ3"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-01-01to2023-06-30" name="dei:EntityInteractiveDataCurrent">Yes</ix:nonNumeric></span> &#9746; No &#9744;</span></p>

