    <p id="xdx_F14_zJHNVBnsjvu6" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><ix:footnote id="Footnote000875" xml:lang="en-US">During 2020, Gix Media engaged with a subcontractor
for the development of an internal-use software (the &#8220;Software&#8221;). Gix Media capitalized its developments costs until March
1, 2022 and from this date the Software became available for use. Accordingly, Gix Media recognized amortization expenses over the estimated
useful life of the Software determined to be three years. For the six months ended June 30, 2023, and the period from March 1, 2022,
until December 31, 2022, Gix Media recorded amortization expenses of $<span id="xdx_90B_ecustom--IntangibleAssetsNetIncludingGoodwilAmortization_pn3n3_c20230101__20230630__us-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis__us-gaap--SoftwareDevelopmentMember_zYCLfk6cSh2l" title="Amortization expenses" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEdPT0RXSUxMIEFORCBJTlRBTkdJQkxFIEFTU0VUUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="VBIX:IntangibleAssetsNetIncludingGoodwilAmortization" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-06-30_us-gaap_SoftwareDevelopmentMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">69</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_905_ecustom--IntangibleAssetsNetIncludingGoodwilAmortization_pn3n3_c20220301__20221231__us-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis__us-gaap--SoftwareDevelopmentMember_zpONkjR9wl11" title="Amortization expenses" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEdPT0RXSUxMIEFORCBJTlRBTkdJQkxFIEFTU0VUUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="VBIX:IntangibleAssetsNetIncludingGoodwilAmortization" contextRef="From2022-03-012022-12-31_us-gaap_SoftwareDevelopmentMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">122</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively.</ix:footnote></p></td></tr>
