<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>D.
Short term loan:</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
December 18, 2020, the Company entered into a loan agreement and Stock Subscription Agreement with certain Investors, pursuant to which
the Investors lent an aggregate amount of $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_pn3n3_c20201218__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAndStockSubscriptionAgreementMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--InvestorsMember_zWr5RuHCaSeb"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-18_custom_LoanAndStockSubscriptionAgreementMember_custom_InvestorsMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">69</ix:nonFraction></span> at an annual interest rate of <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_c20201218__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAndStockSubscriptionAgreementMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--InvestorsMember_zkIzjlIQ49h"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-18_custom_LoanAndStockSubscriptionAgreementMember_custom_InvestorsMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">8</ix:nonFraction></span>% (the &#8220;Loan&#8221;). In January 2023, the Company
reached an agreement with the investors that the Loan received will be repaid in 3 equal monthly payments. In April 2023, the Loan was
fully repaid by the Company.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


