    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
    June 29, 2023, Cortex declared and distributed a dividend in the total amount of $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--PaymentsOfDividendsMinorityInterest_pn3n3_c20230629__20230629__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--CortexMember_zWrEWP9E8io3" title="Dividends non controling interest"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsOfDividendsMinorityInterest" contextRef="From2023-06-292023-06-29_custom_CortexMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">153</ix:nonFraction></span> to the non-controlling interests.</span></td></tr>
